  "title": "Preparing for 2027 Prior Auth Regulatory Requirements",
  "summary": "Prior authorization is one of the biggest sources of administrative burden in healthcare, and it is now the subject of a regulatory deadline. CMS-0057-F and HTI-4 require payers and providers to support electronic prior authorization workflows built on FHIR, with enforcement beginning January 2027.",
